      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاسَهُ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَبُوسُهُ</span>, (S,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَوْسٌ</span>, a Persian
word, arabicized, (S, A, K,) <i>He kissed him.</i> (S,
A, K.) You say also, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاسَ لَهُ الأَرْضَ</span> <i>He kissed
the ground to him.</i> (A, TA.)

